Boundary notes:
  ad-ds = on-premises Active Directory directory services: NTDS, replication, FSMO, Group
  Policy, Kerberos, hardening, tiered administration, LAPS, gMSA, trusts, sites, RODC,
  SYSVOL, version differences across 2016/2019/2022/2025.
  Certificate services (PKI, ESC vulnerabilities) routes to ad-cs.
  Federation services (SAML, claims rules, WAP) routes to ad-fs.
  Entra ID (Azure AD, Conditional Access, PIM, Entra Connect) routes to entra-id.
  AD-integrated DNS routes to windows-dns-ops.
  Credential custody (KRBTGT, keytabs, gMSA root key) routes to secrets-hygiene.

